  "name": "actual",
  "category": "hobby",
  "description": "Actual 是一款超快、注重隐私的个人财务管理应用。",
  "version": "latest",
  "logo": "/assets/app-icons/actual-budget.svg",
  "website": "https://actualbudget.org/",
  "tutorial": "【包含服务】\n  · actual-server — actualbudget/actual-server:latest\n\n【目录映射】宿主机路径 → 容器内路径\n  /portainer/Files/AppData/Config/actual → /data\n\n【端口映射】宿主机:容器\n  5007 → 5006/tcp（actual-server）\n\n【访问地址】\n  http://\u003c主机IP\u003e:5007（actual-server）\n\n【提示】\n  部署前请确认上述目录在宿主机上已有读写权限；端口与目录映射均可在部署向导中按需调整。",
  "dotenv": "",
  "compose": "services:\n    actual-server:\n        container_name: actual\n        ports:\n            - 5007:5006\n        volumes:\n            - ./actual:/data\n        image: 'actualbudget/actual-server:latest'\n        restart: unless-stopped\n",
